# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，检出时由客户端决定（避免 CRLF/LF 反复产生幽灵改动）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.jar  binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 锁文件：视作普通文本，但不出现在 diff 统计里
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
